# Derived render outputs. The gate evidence in cities/*/gates/ is committed;
# everything in out/ is scratch and regenerates from `pixelmap greybox`.
cities/*/out/
cities/*/cache/*.pickle
cities/*/cache/*.log

# Raw LiDAR rasters — 54 MB of GeoTIFF for Limerick alone, and re-downloadable
# from the manifest inside heights.json.gz, which IS committed.
cities/*/cache/lidar/tiles/

# The repo root ignores *.png; gate evidence and analysis figures are the
# record of each decision, so re-include them explicitly.
!cities/*/gates/*.png
!cities/*/analysis/*.png
